# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5804 (ManageSieve), with capability lines in the shape a
# Pigeonhole server sends them. Not a recording.
# A wrong password. The reply to AUTHENTICATE is a rejected credential whatever
# its words say.
S: "SASL" "PLAIN"
S: "STARTTLS"
S: OK
C: STARTTLS
S: OK
TLS
S: "SASL" "PLAIN"
S: OK
C: AUTHENTICATE "PLAIN" "AG1lQGV4YW1wbGUudGVzdABzM2NyZXQ="
S: NO "Authentication failed."
FAIL AuthRejected
